ent response of malignant gliomas to bevacizumab and irinotecan by imaging proliferation with [18F] fluorothymidine positron emission tomography: a pilot study</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>2007</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>4714</fpage><lpage>4721</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Clin Oncol||25|4714||bib5|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17947718</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Duran</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Kortmansky</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Hirte</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Kocha</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Goss</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Le</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Oza</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Nicklee</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Ho</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Birle</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Pond</surname><given-names>GR</given-names></name><name><surname>Arboine</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Dancey</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>viel-Ronen</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsao</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Hedley</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Siu</surname><given-names>LL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A phase II clinical and pharmacodynamic study of temsirolimus in advanced neuroendocrine carcinomas</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>2006</year><volume>95</volume><fpage>1148</fpage><lpage>1154</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||95|1148||bib6|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17